biolink:AnatomicalEntityPartOfAnatomicalEntityAssociation a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "A relationship between two anatomical entities where the relationship is mereological, i.e the two entities are related by parthood, that is, the subject is a part of the object entity (the expected predicate is \"biolink:part_of\" or suitable predicate slots inheriting from it, i.e., \"biolink:plasma_membrane_part_of\",  \"biolink:variant_part_of\", etc.). This includes relationships between cellular components and cells, between cells and tissues, tissues and whole organisms." ;
	sh:closed true ;
