	rdfs:comment "Describes a relationship in which a chemical entity affects the sensitivity or susceptibility of a biological system to a gene or gene product (e.g. a chemical that increases or decreases the response to a gene or gene product). This covers 'response to substance' style interactions from sources such as CTD that map to the 'affects sensitivity to' predicate hierarchy, as opposed to the abundance/activity/processing effects covered by ChemicalAffectsGeneAssociation." ;
