_:c14n8104 sh:description "A qualifier that composes with a core subject/object  concept to describe something that is derived from the core concept.  For example, the qualifier ‘metabolite’ combines with a ‘Chemical X’ core concept to express the composed concept ‘a metabolite of Chemical X’.  This qualifier is for the subject of an association (or statement)." ;
