	sh:nodeKind sh:Literal ;
	sh:order 9 ;
	sh:path biolink:related_synonym .
_:c14n8641 sh:description "A statement-level qualifier used with the 'associated with' predicate (or one of its subpredicates) to indicate the biological, clinical, or statistical basis of the asserted association. Use this qualifier when no more specific predicate exists to capture the intended meaning of the association." ;
