_:c14n992 sh:description "A qualifier that composes with a core subject/object concept to define a more specific version of the subject concept, specifically using an ontology term that is not a subclass or descendant of the core concept and in the vast majority of cases, is of a different ontological namespace than the category or namespace of the subject identifier." ;
