_:c14n9926 sh:description "A database cross reference or alternative identifier for a NamedThing or edge between two NamedThings.  This property should point to a database record or webpage that supports the existence of the edge, or gives more detail about the edge. This property can be used on a node or edge to provide multiple URIs or CURIE cross references." ;
	sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ;
	sh:order 8 ;
	sh:path biolink:xref .
